{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":29,"alongside":30,"kin":31,"engines":56,"usedOn":57,"sites":70,"crewed":71,"museums":72,"hero":73},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/rd-107-108.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"specs":14,"science":19,"credit":21,"links":22,"tagline":27,"description":28},"rd-107-108","RD-107 / RD-108","engine","Roscosmos","USSR / Russia","NPO Energomash","1957-08-21","ACTIVE","1957-1969","first-steps","R-7引擎——在Soyuz上运送航天员已超过65年",{"cycle":15,"propellant":16,"thrust_kn_sl":17,"isp_sl_s":18},"gas-generator","LOX / RP-1",839,256,[20],"propulsion/thrust-and-twr","Engine registry (PRD-032). Public-source nominal specs.",[23],{"l":24,"u":25,"t":26},"RD-107 — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RD-107","intro","Sputnik的发动机——65年后仍在运送航天员","RD-107和RD-108是R-7的发动机；R-7是世界上第一种洲际弹道导弹，被谢尔盖·科罗廖夫的团队改造为运载火箭。RD-107为R-7的四个并联助推器提供动力，RD-108驱动芯级。两款发动机都采用以LOX和煤油为推进剂的燃气发生器循环，都在1957年8月21日首飞——比Sputnik早数月。升级为RD-107A和RD-108A后，它们继续为运送航天员前往国际空间站的Soyuz火箭提供动力，成为有史以来服役时间最长的载人级推进系统。",[],[],[32,36,40,44,48,52],{"id":33,"name":34,"tagline":35},"rd-253","RD-253","六台自燃推进剂发动机，驱动每一枚Proton的第一级",{"id":37,"name":38,"tagline":39},"rd-180","RD-180","俄罗斯富氧分级燃烧技术——美国无法复制",{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"lr87","LR87","双燃烧室自燃推进剂第一级发动机，送出了每一个Gemini乘组",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"h-1","H-1","八台发动机，八次任务——Saturn I的主力发动机",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"rocketdyne-a7","Rocketdyne A-7","发射第一位美国人进入太空的火箭发动机",{"id":53,"name":54,"tagline":55},"rl10","RL10","氢上面级，六十年生涯还在继续",[],[58,62,66],{"id":59,"name":60,"tagline":61},"vostok-k","Vostok-K (8K72K)","将加加林送入太空的 R-7 衍生苏联运载火箭——Vostok 1（1961-04-12）以及截至 1963 年的另外 5 次 Vostok 飞行",{"id":63,"name":64,"tagline":65},"voskhod-11a57","Voskhod (11A57)","Vostok-K 的继任者——为更重的 Voskhod 飞船提供更大推力。发射了 Voskhod 1（1964）和 Voskhod 2（1965，列昂诺夫舱外活动）",{"id":67,"name":68,"tagline":69},"soyuz","Soyuz (11A511)","为第一代 Soyuz 飞船设计的 R-7 衍生运载火箭——发射了 Soyuz 1（1967）和 Soyuz 11（1971）",[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/rd-107-108/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
